+     * fails we return the corresponding error code u2013 the caller will see ENOENT for
+     * missing tags or EINVAL for invalid data.
+     *
+     * The credentials are also configured on the TLS context at this point, which
+     * is safe because subsequent connection attempts will simply reuse the already
